  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "35001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3090201": {
            "id": "3090201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew, it's finally done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090202"
            ]
          },
          "3090202": {
            "id": "3090202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, all that \"ley flow\" and \"elemental lines\" stuff Lisa was going on about should hopefully be back to normal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090203"
            ]
          },
          "3090203": {
            "id": "3090203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wanna go back and see how the <color=#00E1FFFF>Knights</color> are doing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090204"
            ]
          },
          "3090204": {
            "id": "3090204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But if you got anything more interesting to do, Paimon can come too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090205"
            ]
          },
          "3090205": {
            "id": "3090205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Like... going on a shopping spree... or checking out the <color=#00E1FFFF>Statue of The Seven</color> again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090206"
            ]
          },
          "3090206": {
            "id": "3090206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "At the temples of The Four Winds, we found something like... solidified wind, didn't we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090207"
            ]
          },
          "3090207": {
            "id": "3090207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In Mondstadt, people call them \"Anemoculi.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090208"
            ]
          },
          "3090208": {
            "id": "3090208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They're called this because they can be fitted into the statue's eyes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090209"
            ]
          },
          "3090209": {
            "id": "3090209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Some fairy tales say the statues' eyes originally had gems that were taken by swallows.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090210"
            ]
          },
          "3090210": {
            "id": "3090210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Anemoculi never had a physical form from the start.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090212"
            ]
          },
          "3090212": {
            "id": "3090212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "People with Visions collect them to offer to the <color=#00E1FFFF>statues</color> in exchange for blessings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090213"
            ]
          },
          "3090213": {
            "id": "3090213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Unlike others with powers, you don't have a Vision. But then the rules of this world don't apply to you anyway so...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090214"
            ]
          },
          "3090214": {
            "id": "3090214",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We can go see what happens right now, if you wanna try!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090215"
            ]
          },
          "3090215": {
            "id": "3090215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The statue in Windrise should be the closest one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090216"
            ]
          },
          "3090216": {
            "id": "3090216",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon can't wait to see what the gods do to you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35000",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
