            "text": "..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35001",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500101": {
            "id": "3500101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How about we explore the area ahead of us later?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35003",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500301": {
            "id": "3500301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Two stars clashed with the heart of a shattered world",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500302"
            ]
          },
          "3500302": {
            "id": "3500302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Of the twins that fell to this world, one is awaking from slumber",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500303"
            ]
          },
          "3500303": {
            "id": "3500303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You opened your eyes in the bitter cold with the hope for a better world",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500304"
            ]
          },
          "3500304": {
            "id": "3500304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#Only to be greeted by the sight of your {M#sister}{F#brother} being impaled by chains",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500305"
            ]
          },
          "3500305": {
            "id": "3500305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A foreign goddess descends from the skies and takes away your only kin",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500306"
            ]
          },
          "3500306": {
            "id": "3500306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yet failing to avenge your twin, you succumbed to a dark slumber...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500307"
            ]
          },
          "3500307": {
            "id": "3500307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "When you come to, the world around you is not as you remember",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500308"
            ]
          },
          "3500308": {
            "id": "3500308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Time that remained stagnant for an eternity began flowing anew",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500309"
            ]
          },
          "3500309": {
            "id": "3500309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You embarked on a perilous journey alone",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500310"
            ]
          },
          "3500310": {
            "id": "3500310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "In search of the goddess who took everything from you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500311"
            ]
          },
          "3500311": {
            "id": "3500311",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Two months later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35004",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500401": {
            "id": "3500401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... what you're trying to say is that you fell here... from another world?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500402"
            ]
          },
          "3500402": {
            "id": "3500402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But when you wanted to leave, and go on to the next world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500403"
            ]
          },
          "3500403": {
            "id": "3500403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Your path was blocked by some unknown god?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500404"
            ]
          },
          "3500404": {
            "id": "3500404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "God",
            "text": "Outlanders, your journey ends here",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500405"
            ]
          },
          "3500405": {
            "id": "3500405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Who're you!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500406"
            ]
          },
          "3500406": {
            "id": "3500406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "God",
            "text": "The sustainer of heavenly principles. The arrogation of mankind ends now",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500417"
            ]
          },
          "3500417": {
            "id": "3500417",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Lumine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500418"
            ]
          },
          "3500418": {
            "id": "3500418",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Aether!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500424"
            ]
          },
          "3500424": {
            "id": "3500424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#Give my {M#sister}{F#brother} back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500425"
            ]
          },
          "3500425": {
            "id": "3500425",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#And just like that, the god took away my {M#sister}{F#brother}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500426"
            ]
          },
          "3500426": {
            "id": "3500426",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Some kind of seal was cast upon me, and I lost my power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500427"
            ]
          },
          "3500427": {
            "id": "3500427",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{M#So while we used to travel from world to world, we are now trapped here.}{F#So whilst we used to cross world after world, we are now trapped here.}",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500428"
            ]
          },
          "3500428": {
            "id": "3500428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How many years ago was it? I don't know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500429"
            ]
          },
          "3500429": {
            "id": "3500429",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But I intend to find out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500430"
            ]
          },
          "3500430": {
            "id": "3500430",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{M#When I woke, I was all alone — until I met you two months ago...}{F#After I awoke, I was all alone — right up until I met you two months ago.}",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500431"
            ]
          },
          "3500431": {
            "id": "3500431",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, Paimon really owes you for that. Otherwise Paimon likely would have drowned...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500432"
            ]
          },
          "3500432": {
            "id": "3500432",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, Paimon will do her best to be a great guide!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500434"
            ]
          },
          "3500434": {
            "id": "3500434",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We should head off. Let's get going!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}